","Ma'na","Column 2 (Jumla)","Ma'na"],"rows":[["Misaal 1","مُجْرِمُونَ","mujrim log","هَٰؤُلَاءِ مُجْرِمُونَ","yeh log mujrim hain"],["Misaal 2","شُفَعَاءُ","sifaarish karne waale","هَٰؤُلَاءِ شُفَعَاءُ","yeh log sifaarishi hain"],["Misaal 3","آلِهَةٌ","ma'boodon","هَٰؤُلَاءِ آلِهَةٌ","yeh sab ma'bood hain"]]}},{"type":"rule_paragraph","text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0 18px 0;text-align:center;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 236\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:800px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"hdrGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0f766e\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#047857\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect width=\"800\" height=\"58\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"url(#hdrGrad)\"/>\n  <rect y=\"42\" width=\"800\" height=\"16\" fill=\"url(#hdrGrad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\">Unit 5 • Sabaq 18 (Page 91): Ism-e-Ishaara Qareeb Jama (هَٰؤُلَاءِ — Yeh Log)</text>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"46\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#ccfbf1\">مُسْلِمُونَ (musalman) ← هَٰؤُلَاءِ مُسْلِمُونَ (yeh log musalman hain)</text>\n  <rect x=\"18\" y=\"14\" width=\"110\" height=\"28\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(255,255,255,0.18)\"/>\n  <text x=\"73\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffffff\">S5L18 • Page 91</text>\n  \n        <g transform=\"translate(20, 74)\">\n          <rect width=\"240\" height=\"118\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#ecfdf5\" stroke=\"#059669\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" direction=\"rtl\">مُجْرِمُونَ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#059669\">↓</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#059669\" direction=\"rtl\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ مُجْرِمُونَ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">mujrim → yeh log mujrim hain</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">Haa'ulaa'i + Jama</text>\n        </g>\n        <g transform=\"translate(280, 74)\">\n          <rect width=\"240\" height=\"118\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f0f9ff\" stroke=\"#0284c7\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" direction=\"rtl\">شُفَعَاءُ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0284c7\">↓</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0284c7\" direction=\"rtl\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ شُفَعَاؤُنَا</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">sifaarishi → yeh hamaare sifaarishi hain</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">Qareeb ke jama ki taraf ishaara</text>\n        </g>\n        <g transform=\"translate(540, 74)\">\n          <rect width=\"240\" height=\"118\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"#f5f3ff\" stroke=\"#7c3aed\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"20\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#1e293b\" direction=\"rtl\">آلِهَةٌ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"52\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\">↓</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"76\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"'Amiri','Scheherazade New',serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#7c3aed\" direction=\"rtl\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ آلِهَةٌ</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"96\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0f172a\">ma'bood → yeh ma'bood hain</text>\n          <text x=\"120\" y=\"111\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">Mard ya khawaateen donon ke liye</text>\n        </g>\n  <rect x=\"30\" y=\"202\" width=\"740\" height=\"24\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#334155\">Qaa'ida: (هَٰؤُلَاءِ) ka matlab 'yeh log / aise log' hai — qareeb ke bahut se mardon ya khawaateen ki taraf ishaara.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>(هَٰؤُلَاءِ) ka matlab 'yeh log / aise log' hai. Yeh lafz bahut se mardon ya khawaateen ki jaanib ishaara karke unke baare mein koi baat karne ke liye istemaal hota hai. Zyaada-tar alfaaz pehle guzar chuke hain:","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0 18px 0;text-align:center;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 236\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:800px;height:auto;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"hdrGrad\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"0%\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0f766e\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100