"10.5\" fill=\"#475569\">Mard ya khawaateen donon ke liye</text>\n        </g>\n  <rect x=\"30\" y=\"202\" width=\"740\" height=\"24\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#cbd5e1\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"218\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#334155\">Qaa'ida: (هَٰؤُلَاءِ) ka matlab 'yeh log / aise log' hai — qareeb ke bahut se mardon ya khawaateen ki taraf ishaara.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>(هَٰؤُلَاءِ) ka matlab 'yeh log / aise log' hai. Yeh lafz bahut se mardon ya khawaateen ki jaanib ishaara karke unke baare mein koi baat karne ke liye istemaal hota hai. Zyaada-tar alfaaz pehle guzar chuke hain:"}},{"type":"section_label","text":"1. Jama ka Lafz : (هَٰؤُلَاءِ) ke saath Qur'ani Jumle (11 Pairs)","data":{"text":"1. Jama ka Lafz : (هَٰؤُلَاءِ) ke saath Qur'ani Jumle (11 Pairs)"}},{"type":"two_col_numbered_list","is_numbered":false,"data":{"items":[{"id":"s5l18_w_1","arabic":"آلِهَةٌ ← هَٰؤُلَاءِ آلِهَةٌ","hinglish":"ma'bood -> Yeh ma'bood hain","translations":{"en":"These are deities","ur":"یہ معبود ہیں","hi":"यह माबूद हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">آلِهَةٌ</span> ← <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">آلِهَةٌ</span>","displayOrder":1},{"id":"s5l18_w_7","arabic":"قَوْمٌ ← هَٰؤُلَاءِ قَوْمٌ","hinglish":"ek qaum -> Yeh log ek qaum hain","translations":{"en":"These people are a nation","ur":"یہ لوگ قوم ہیں","hi":"यह लोग क़ौम हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمٌ</span> ← <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">قَوْمٌ</span>","displayOrder":2},{"id":"s5l18_w_2","arabic":"لَضَالُّونَ ← إِنَّ هَٰؤُلَاءِ لَضَالُّونَ","hinglish":"yaqeenan gumraah -> Beshak yeh log yaqeenan gumraah hain","translations":{"en":"Indeed, these people are surely lost","ur":"بے شک یہ لوگ یقیناً گمراہ ہیں","hi":"बेशक यह लोग यक़ीनन गुमराह हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">لَضَالُّونَ</span> ← <span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَضَالُّونَ</span>","displayOrder":3},{"id":"s5l18_w_8","arabic":"لَشِرْذِمَةٌ ← إِنَّ هَٰؤُلَاءِ لَشِرْذِمَةٌ","hinglish":"ek chhota sa giroh -> Beshak yeh log ek chhota sa giroh hain","translations":{"en":"These are indeed a small band","ur":"یہ لوگ ایک چھوٹا سا گروہ ہیں","hi":"यह लोग एक छोटा सा गिरोह हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">لَشِرْذِمَةٌ</span> ← <span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">لَشِرْذِمَةٌ</span>","displayOrder":4},{"id":"s5l18_w_3","arabic":"شُرَكَاؤُنَا ← هَٰؤُلَاءِ شُرَكَاؤُنَا","hinglish":"hamare shareek -> Yeh hamare shareek hain","translations":{"en":"These are our partners","ur":"یہ ہمارے شریک ہیں","hi":"यह हमारे शरीक हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">شُرَكَاؤ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُنَا</span> ← <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شُرَكَاؤ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُنَا</span>","displayOrder":5},{"id":"s5l18_w_9","arabic":"ضَيْفِي ← إِنَّ هَٰؤُلَاءِ ضَيْفِي","hinglish":"mere mehmaan -> Beshak yeh log mere mehmaan hain","translations":{"en":"These are my guests","ur":"یہ میرے مہمان ہیں","hi":"यह मेरे मेहमान हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">ضَيْفِي</span> ← <span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">ضَيْفِي</span>","displayOrder":6},{"id":"s5l18_w_4","arabic":"شُفَعَاؤُنَا ← هَٰؤُلَاءِ شُفَعَاؤُنَا","hinglish":"hamare sifarishi -> Yeh hamare sifarishi hain","translations":{"en":"These are our intercessors","ur":"یہ ہمارے سفارشی ہیں","hi":"यह हमारे सिफ़ारिशी हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">شُفَعَاؤ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُنَا</span> ← <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شُفَعَاؤ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُنَا</span>","displayOrder":7},{"id":"s5l18_w_10","arabic":"أَهْدَىٰ ← هَٰؤُلَاءِ أَهْدَىٰ","hinglish":"zyada hidayat par -> Yeh log zyada seedhe raaste par hain","translations":{"en":"These are better guided","ur":"یہ لوگ زیادہ ہدایت پر ہیں","hi":"यह लोग ज़्यादा हिदायत पर हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">أَهْدَىٰ</span> ← <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">أَهْدَىٰ</span>","displayOrder":8},{"id":"s5l18_w_5","arabic":"بَنَاتِي ← هَٰؤُلَاءِ بَنَاتِي","hinglish":"meri betiyan -> Yeh meri betiyan hain","translations":{"en":"These are my daughters","ur":"یہ میری بیٹیاں ہیں","hi":"यह मेरी बेटियां हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">بَنَاتِي</span> ← <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">بَنَاتِي</span>","displayOrder":9},{"id":"s5l18_w_11","arabic":"قَوْمٌ مُجْرِمُونَ ← إِنَّ هَٰؤُلَاءِ قَوْمٌ مُجْرِمُونَ","hinglish":"mujrim qaum -> Beshak yeh log mujrim qaum hain","translations":{"en":"These are a criminal people","ur":"یہ لوگ مجرم قوم ہیں","hi":"यह लोग मुजरिम क़ौम हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُجْرِم</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُونَ</span> ← <span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">قَوْمٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُجْرِم</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُونَ</span>","displayOrder":10},{"id":"s5l18_w_6","arabic":"قَوْمُنَا ← هَٰؤُلَاءِ قَوْمُنَا","hinglish":"hamari qaum -> Yeh hamari qaum hai","translations":{"en":"These are our people","ur":"یہ ہماری قوم ہے","hi":"यह हमारी क़ौम है"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْم</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُنَا</span> ← <span class=\"nonroot\">هَٰؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْم</span><span class=\"nonroot\">ُنَا</span>","displayOrder":11}],"is_numbered":false,"sortedByDisplayOrder":true},"sortedByDisplayOrder":true},{"type":"rule_paragraph","text":"Darj-e-zail Qur'ani qat'aat ka tarjuma karein:","data":{"text":"Darj-e-zail Qur'ani qat'aat ka tarjuma karein:"}},{"type":"section_label","text":"2. (هَٰؤُلَاءِ) waale Qur'ani Qat'aat (6 Phrases)","data":{"text":"2. (هَٰؤُلَاءِ) waale Qur'ani Qat'aat (6 Phrases)"}},{"type":"two_col_numbered_list","is_numbered":false,"data":{"items":[{"id":"s5l18_ph_1","arabic":"وَمِنْ هَؤُلَاءِ","hinglish":"Aur in logon mein se","translations":{"en":"And from among these","ur":"اور ان لوگوں میں سے","hi":"और इन लोगों में से"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">وَمِنْ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span>"},{"id":"s5l18_ph_2","arabic":"إِنَّ هَؤُلَاءِ","hinglish":"Beshak yeh log","translations":{"en":"Indeed, these people","ur":"بے شک یہ لوگ","hi":"बेशक यह लोग"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span>"},{"id":"s5l18_ph_3","arabic":"شَهِيدًا عَلَى هَؤُلَاءِ","hinglish":"In logon par gawah bana kar","translations":{"en":"A witness against these","ur":"ان لوگوں پر گواہ","hi":"इन लोगों पर गवाह"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">شَهِيدًا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span>","ref":"16:89"},{"id":"s5l18_ph_4","arabic":"هَؤُلَاءِ وَهَؤُلَاءِ","hinglish":"Un ko bhi aur in ko bhi","translations":{"en":"These and these","ur":"ان کو بھی اور ان کو بھی","hi":"इनको भी और इनको भी"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">وَهَؤُلَاءِ</span>"},{"id":"s5l18_ph_5","arabic":"هَؤُلَاءِ وَآبَاءَهُمْ","hinglish":"Inko aur inke baap-dada ko","translations":{"en":"These and their forefathers","ur":"ان کو اور ان کے باپ دادا کو","hi":"इनको और इनके बाप-दादा को"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَآبَاءَهُمْ</span>"},{"id":"s5l18_ph_6","arabic":"عَلَى هَؤُلَاءِ شَهِيدًا","hinglish":"Un logon par gawah bana kar","translations":{"en":"A witness against these","ur":"ان لوگوں پر گواہ بنا کر","hi":"इन लोगों पर गवाह बना कर"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَلَى</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شَهِيدًا</span>","ref":"4:41"}],"is_numbered":false}},{"type":"rule_paragraph","text":"Ab darj-e-zail Qur'ani jumlon aur aayaat ka tarjuma karein:","data":{"text":"Ab darj-e-zail Qur'ani jumlon aur aayaat ka tarjuma karein:"}},{"type":"section_label","text":"3. (هَٰؤُلَاءِ) waali Qur'ani Aayaat (Numbered 1–8)","data":{"text":"3. (هَٰؤُلَاءِ) waali Qur'ani Aayaat (Numbered 1–8)"}},{"type":"two_col_numbered_list","is_numbered":true,"data":{"items":[{"id":"s5l18_s_1","arabic":"إِنَّ هَؤُلَاءِ لَضَالُّونَ","hinglish":"Beshak yeh log yaqeenan behke hue/gumraah hain","sentence_number":1,"translations":{"en":"Indeed, these people are surely astray","ur":"بے شک یہ لوگ یقیناً بہکے ہوئے/گمراہ ہیں","hi":"बेशक यह लोग यक़ीनन बहके हुए/गुमराह हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَضَالُّونَ</span>","ref":"83:32"},{"id":"s5l18_s_2","arabic":"إِنَّ هَؤُلَاءِ ضَيْفِي","hinglish":"Beshak yeh mere mehmaan hain","sentence_number":2,"translations":{"en":"Indeed, these are my guests","ur":"بے شک یہ میرے مہمان ہیں","hi":"बेशक यह मेरे मेहमान हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">ضَيْفِي</span>","ref":"15:68"},{"id":"s5l18_s_3","arabic":"رَبَّنَا هَؤُلَاءِ شُرَكَاؤُنَا","hinglish":"Ae hamare Rab! Yeh hamare woh shareek hain jinhein hum poojte thay","sentence_number":3,"translations":{"en":"Our Lord, these are our partners","ur":"اے ہمارے رب! یہ ہمارے وہ شریک ہیں جنہیں ہم پوجتے تھے","hi":"ऐ हमारे रब! यह हमारे वह शरीक हैं जिन्हें हम पूजते थे"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">رَبَّ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">نَا</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شُرَكَاؤُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">نَا</span>","ref":"16:86"},{"id":"s5l18_s_4","arabic":"هَؤُلَاءِ شُفَعَاؤُنَا عِنْدَ اللهِ","hinglish":"Yeh Allah ke paas hamare sifarishi hain","sentence_number":4,"translations":{"en":"These are our intercessors with Allah","ur":"یہ اللہ کے پاس ہمارے سفارشی ہیں","hi":"यह अल्लाह के पास हमारे सिफ़ारिशी हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">شُفَعَاؤُ</span><span class=\"nonroot\">نَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عِنْدَ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">اللهِ</span>","ref":"10:18"},{"id":"s5l18_s_5","arabic":"أَنَّ هَؤُلَاءِ قَوْمٌ مُّجْرِمُونَ","hinglish":"Ke yeh log mujrim qaum hain","sentence_number":5,"translations":{"en":"That these are a criminal people","ur":"کہ یہ لوگ مجرم قوم ہیں","hi":"कि यह लोग मुजरिम क़ौम हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">أَنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">مُّجْرِمُونَ</span>","ref":"44:22"},{"id":"s5l18_s_6","arabic":"إِنَّ هَؤُلَاءِ لَشِرْذِمَةٌ قَلِيلُونَ","hinglish":"Beshak yeh ek thodi si jamaat hain","sentence_number":6,"translations":{"en":"Indeed, these are a small band","ur":"بے شک یہ ایک تھوڑی سی جماعت ہیں","hi":"बेशक यह एक थोड़ी सी जमाअत हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">إِنَّ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">لَشِرْذِمَةٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَلِيلُونَ</span>","ref":"26:54"},{"id":"s5l18_s_7","arabic":"لَا إِلَى هَؤُلَاءِ وَلَا إِلَى هَؤُلَاءِ","hinglish":"Na woh in logon ki taraf hain aur na un logon ki taraf","sentence_number":7,"translations":{"en":"Neither to these nor to those","ur":"نہ ان کی طرف اور نہ ان کی طرف (ڈانواں ڈول ہیں)","hi":"न इनकी तरफ़ और न उनकी तरफ़ (डांवाडोल हैं)"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">لَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">وَلَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">إِلَى</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span>","ref":"4:143"},{"id":"s5l18_s_8","arabic":"يَا قَوْمِ هَؤُلَاءِ بَنَاتِي","hinglish":"Ae meri qaum! Yeh meri qaum ki betiyan hazir hain","sentence_number":8,"translations":{"en":"O my people, these are my daughters","ur":"اے میری قوم! یہ میری قوم کی بیٹیاں حاضر ہیں","hi":"ऐ मेरी क़ौम! यह मेरी क़ौम की बेटियां हाज़िर हैं"},"arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">يَا</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">قَوْمِ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">هَؤُلَاءِ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">بَنَاتِي</span>","ref":"11:78"}],"is_numbered":true}}]}}